# Disk images, in every form one might arrive in. The overlay quickstart.txt
# creates is the likely one, and it is as large as the image behind it - but
# the base image itself is TWC's software and must never be committed either,
# whatever it is named.
*.qcow2
*.qcow
*.img
*.vmdk
*.raw
*.vdi
*.vhd
*.vhdx
*.iso

# The card's output and capture FIFOs, its QMP socket and its serial log.
is1-in-v
is1-in-a
is1-output
qmp.sock
serial.log

# Built from the sources in tools/.
tools/is1ndi/is1ndi
tools/is1view/is1view
*.o
*.so

# The QEMU fork, if you clone it in here rather than beside it.
qemu-is1/

# Editor and OS litter.
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
